{"id":"666575","name":"枣仁派","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/666575/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"2斤"},{"name":"核桃仁","amount":"一斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红枣清洗干净。","img":"images/666575/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去核，剪开。","img":"images/666575/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大火隔水蒸10分钟。","img":"images/666575/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"核桃仁小火炒香(10分钟左右)。","img":"images/666575/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"红枣皮朝下，平铺在烤盘中。","img":"images/666575/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再铺上核桃仁。","img":"images/666575/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再铺满一层红枣，红枣皮朝上。","img":"images/666575/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用擀面杖擀实。","img":"images/666575/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"刷一层蜂蜜。","img":"images/666575/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上白芝麻。","img":"images/666575/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入预热好的烤箱，130度，烤15～20分钟。","img":"images/666575/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"测底晾凉后，再切块即可。","img":"images/666575/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/666575/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"来一块，营养又美味。","img":"images/666575/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"红枣要铺满一些，不要留空隙。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}